---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
    title="Press · Sanctum Haus"
    description="Press kit, founder bio, and contact for Sanctum."
>
    <main>
        <p class="tagline">Press</p>
        <h1>Press kit</h1>
        <p class="lede">
            Building a kit you can actually use. Until then, the short
            version below.
        </p>

        <h2>One-liner</h2>
        <p>
            <em>
                Sanctum is a council of local AI agents that runs on
                hardware you own, for a family you actually have.
            </em>
        </p>

        <h2>Founder</h2>
        <p>
            Bertrand Nepveu, venture capitalist at Triptyq Capital, solo
            developer of Sanctum, based in Québec. Father of one
            teenager. Has been running Sanctum on his own family for 14
            months at time of writing.
        </p>

        <h2>Tech, briefly</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Multi-agent council (eight specialized agents)</li>
            <li>Local inference on Apple Silicon (Mac Mini M4 minimum)</li>
            <li>Qwen 3.6 35B-A3B-4bit served at 50+ tokens/sec</li>
            <li>mTLS internal mesh, no cloud dependency at runtime</li>
            <li>Open-source core (FSL-1.1, auto-converts to MIT)</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
            Email <a href="mailto:press@sanctum.haus">press@sanctum.haus</a>
            (rolls to bert@triptyq.vc until the dedicated address is
            wired). Replies within 24 hours.
        </p>

        <h2>Coming soon</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Hi-res hero illustrations (pencil-sketch with teal accents)</li>
            <li>Founder photo</li>
            <li>Demo video (75 sec)</li>
            <li>Logo bundle (light/dark, SVG/PNG)</li>
        </ul>
    </main>
</Base>
